WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:02.000
This melody

00:02.080 --> 00:03.480
Is very sad

00:05.400 --> 00:07.880
This is for the dead below the walls

00:07.960 --> 00:11.960
Learned from the granny with the best musical skill in the fort

00:12.280 --> 00:13.040
They say

00:13.160 --> 00:14.520
This melody

00:14.600 --> 00:16.000
Can soothe the departed

00:17.040 --> 00:18.440
Actually, I think

00:18.600 --> 00:20.040
What really needs soothing

00:20.600 --> 00:22.080
Isn't the departed

00:24.720 --> 00:26.120
In our Shitou Fortress

00:26.440 --> 00:29.107
People often use the time of one melody

00:29.680 --> 00:31.080
To say goodbye

00:31.200 --> 00:32.560
To grieve

00:32.640 --> 00:34.040
To remember

00:35.200 --> 00:37.040
Then quickly forget the pain

00:38.480 --> 00:39.840
To live on properly

00:41.520 --> 00:42.480
Why follow the volunteers

00:42.600 --> 00:44.600
To a dangerous place like Yiyang?

00:46.480 --> 00:48.147
Grandfather is my only family

00:48.440 --> 00:49.680
If I don't follow him

00:49.760 --> 00:51.240
Where else can I go?

